# PropX UI standards

Before implementing or changing any UI (admin or tenant):

1. Read `UI_STANDARDS.md` at the repo root.
2. Reuse existing admin-side components, DataTables (`UserDataTable`), styles in `src/css/dashboard.css`, fonts, colors, spacing, and layout patterns.
3. Do not introduce a new visual design system or duplicate an existing component without justification.

Core rule from `UI_STANDARDS.md`:

> Before implementing any new UI, inspect the existing admin-side implementation and reuse its components, DataTables, styles, fonts, colors, spacing, and layout patterns wherever possible. Do not introduce a new visual design system or duplicate an existing component without justification.
